WEBVTT

00:02.045 --> 00:03.713
Previously on lost:

00:03.796 --> 00:04.964
Is that a helicopter?

00:05.048 --> 00:07.467
Is that how a helicopter's
supposed to sound?

00:07.550 --> 00:10.094
Get away from her!

