— right.

00:33.952 --> 00:35.453
You're pregnant.

01:04.440 --> 01:06.192
Hey.

01:07.110 --> 01:09.112
Good morning, Jack.

01:11.239 --> 01:13.241
Thank you.

01:19.205 --> 01:22.750
I came by your tent earlier.

01:22.834 --> 01:24.168
