with your pregnancy.

01:38.224 --> 01:42.687
I'm doing fine. A little tired,
but that's normal, right?

01:42.770 --> 01:47.358
Sure. Any morning sickness?
— not anymore.

01:48.568 --> 01:50.945
Any bleeding?

01:53.781 --> 01:56.409
Why are you asking me
all these questions, Jack?

01:58.286 --> 01:59.620
I'm just checking in.

02:00.705 --> 02:04.834
Now that I'm back, I just wanted
to make sure that you were doing ok.

02:06.085 --> 02:08.755
Thank you. I'm ok.

02:22.643 --> 02:25.855
[Phone ringing]

04:40.031 --> 04:41.616
Who is she? — I've no idea.

04:41.699 --> 04:44.744
She seems to know you, dude.
She just said your name.

04:44.827 --> 04:46.329
Never seen her before in my life.

04:46.412 --> 04:48.789
