she's waking up.

04:50.374 --> 04:53.002
[Mumbles]

04:53.085 --> 04:55.796
She's trying to talk.
We should get her some water.

04:57.131 --> 04:59.133
Give me a hand. — yeah.

05:00.259 --> 05:03.137
[Mutters in Spanish]

05:03.221 --> 05:05.515
What's she saying? — don't know.

05:05.598 --> 05:09.101
It's Spanish, dude.
— do you understand her, then?

05:13.231 --> 05:14.482
She says she's dying.

05:20.780 --> 05:21.781
Oh, my god!

05:21.864 --> 05:24.200
A branch.
She must have hit it on the way down.

05:24.283 --> 05:27.703
Get her pack. We haven't
got much in this first—aid kit.

05:27.787 --> 05:31.082
See if there's anything we can use.
— what if this is a rescue?

05:31.165 --> 05:33.668
What if she came for us?
Is she gonna be ok?

05:33.751 --> 05:36.128
Just go. Start looking.

05:39.590 --> 05:44.053
[Jin] We get Jack. Jack.
— she could be our way off the island.

05:44.136 --> 05:47.723
If we move her, it'll make it worse.
— we just let her bleed to death?

05:47.807 --> 05:51.602
No, we need to bring Jack here.
— It's an eight—hour walk, one way.

05:51.686 --> 05:54.522
Then I'll run.
— are you out of your mind?

05:54.605 --> 05:57.733
It's not safe.
Who knows who's out in this jungle?

05:57.817 --> 06:00.319
People on this island
are trying to kill us.

06:00.403 --> 06:01.571
Nobody knows we're here.

06:07.702 --> 06:09.370
