08:21.252 --> 08:24.839
What do you think happened to Jack
while he was with the others?

08:25.965 --> 08:28.884
Since he's been back,
he seems different.

08:31.137 --> 08:33.389
He says that he was
pretty much a prisoner,

08:33.472 --> 08:37.893
and he only cooperated 'cause he thought
they'd let him off the island.

08:39.478 --> 08:41.480
Do you believe him?

08:43.274 --> 08:45.276
Why wouldn't I?

08:46.485 --> 08:49.488
He came to me,
asking about my pregnancy.

08:50.781 --> 08:53.909
