13:19.008 --> 13:22.511
You understand her.
— she's speaking Italian.

13:22.594 --> 13:25.264
She said she's dying.
She needs help.

13:27.016 --> 13:30.477
I was a Soviet army field medic.
I can offer you my services.

13:31.729 --> 13:34.398
Wait. What are you doing?
— I'm saving her.

13:42.740 --> 13:46.035
This branch has punctured her lung.
It's filling with blood.

13:46.118 --> 13:49.163
If it is not ventilated soon,
she is going to die.

13:53.292 --> 13:55.294
Well, do it. Help her.

13:55.377 --> 13:59.631
If I fix her, you must let me walk away
as if I never came upon you.

14:05.220 --> 14:08.474
[Parachutist gasping]

14:08.557 --> 14:10.559
What do you need?

14:27.910 --> 14:31.455
[Claire laughs]

14:31.538 --> 14:35.084
[Baby coos]

18:01.331 --> 18:04.584
[Screams]
— be quiet. Don't move.

18:05.711 --> 18:09.131
You want me to help you
and your baby, I have answers.

18:09.214 --> 18:11.466
But you have to
come with me right now.

18:11.550 --> 18:14.386
Just you and me. Nobody else.

18:21.393 --> 18:25.314
If what you said was true,
that means I'm already dead.

18:25.397 --> 18:29.401
Why should I go anwvhere with you?
— because there may be hope for you yet.

18:55.093 --> 18:57.054
Where are we going?

18:57.137 --> 19:00.432
There's a medical station.
They have an ultrasound machine.

19:00.515 --> 19:04.311
Claire and Kate
told me about that place.

19:04.394 --> 19:06.772
It was abandoned.
They found nothing there.

19:06.855 --> 19:09.649
Well, that's because
they didn't know where to look.

19:10.317 --> 19:12.778
What are you going to do to me?

19:16.323 --> 19:19.534
I'm gonna look at your baby
and determine the doc.

19:19.618 --> 19:21.036
Date of conception.

19:21.119 --> 19:24.623
The ultrasound will tell me when
you got pregnant, give or take a day.

19:24.706 --> 19:29.336
If you got pregnant off the island, then
you and your baby will probably be ok.

19:30.253 --> 19:33.548
But if you got pregnant here...

19:35.550 --> 19:38.887
We'll cross that bridge
when we come to it.

19:38.970 --> 19:42.140
When was the last time
you and your husband had sex?

19:42.224 --> 19:45.560
I would rather not talk about that.
— I know it's personal.

19:45.644 --> 19:49.898
But if I know when, I can figure...
— isn't that what the machine will do?

19:49.981 --> 19:53.944
Yeah. — then let's keep walking.

20:19.344 --> 20:21.388
